# Base URL of the Arcana backend API, including the /api prefix.
# - Local development in Expo Go on the same machine as the server: http://localhost:4000/api
# - Local development on a physical phone: http://<your-computer's-LAN-IP>:4000/api
# - A build you install as an APK: a real, publicly reachable URL (e.g. after deploying the
#   backend) - "localhost" means "this phone", not your development machine, once the app is
#   no longer running inside Expo Go on the same computer as the server.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
